---
import { asset } from '../data/site.js';
---
<section class="sec guard" id="guard" aria-labelledby="guard-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <figure><img src={asset('img/watch.jpg')} alt="A Rottweiler sitting watchful on a stone step at dusk" width="1136" height="1408" loading="lazy"></figure>
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow rule">For those who serve</div>
      <h2 id="guard-h">For the ones who <em class="g">keep watch.</em></h2>
      <p>Some people stand guard so the rest of us can rest. They keep their word and turn up when it counts. We built Rottweiler on the same values: loyalty, discipline and no shortcuts.</p>
      <p>Our lagers rest at least 30 days in a cold cellar. Every batch is checked against its written spec before it leaves. When the watch is over, we hope you will raise a glass with us.</p>
      <p class="small">Messes, clubs and canteens can <a href="#trade">talk to our trade team about supply</a>. Rottweiler Brew and Pub is an independent brewery. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by any armed force.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
